{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19801","headline":"黄雀吟 · 孟郊","name":"黄雀吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄雀舞承尘，倚恃主人仁。\n主人忽不仁，买弹弹尔身。\n何不远飞去，蓬蒿正繁新。\n蒿粒无人争，食之足爲珍。\n莫覰翻车粟，覰翻罪有因。\n黄雀不知言，赠之徒殷懃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}